================================================================================
VESTA bond cut-offs (data from pymatgen, MIT)
================================================================================

Sources/DiffractoCore/VestaBondCutoffs.swift holds the bond cut-off per element
pair that pymatgen-core 2026.10.16 ships as pymatgen/core/vesta_cutoffs.yaml
(sha256 f2493332b712fabc7ecb1965753ac58fb3dd735603b41d32d25f1cd85361b144) and
reads in CutOffDictNN.from_preset("vesta_2019"); the numbers are VESTA's
(K. Momma and F. Izumi, J. Appl. Cryst. 44 (2011) 1272-1276). The Swift file
is generated from that file by tools/pins/vesta-bonds/generate_cutoffs.py; no
pymatgen code is copied. The table is used under pymatgen's MIT licence, quoted
in full in the section above.

